                "caption": "Figure 3:Data construction.We curate image–text and video–text pairs, gameplay, real-world videos, and synthetic videos to preserve visual capabilities and learn interactive control. Joint-control sequences align segment-level captions and continuous action strengths with video frames, while 30-second clips extend the training context.",
